{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島県出身中学３年生15歳の和田まあやですっm(__)mペコッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の時に二期生のみりあちゃんときょうかちゃんと撮ったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q&A答えるねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここで京都のぶらり旅をやってたけど今度するとしたらどこがいい！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜沖縄\n行ったことないから行ってみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく『沖縄出身！？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』って聞かれるんだぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テヘペロ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのチャームポイントは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜ん自分のコンプレックスな唇〜よくファンの方とかメンバーにチャームポイントだよ！って言われるから......o(T□T)ow"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーに年賀状とか送るのありかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年開けちゃいましたね...答えるの遅くなってすみません...\n全然ありですっ\n沢山の年賀状やファンレター...いつもすごく嬉しいですっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやって勉強してる？何時までしてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤シートとか使ったりとかひたすらノートに書いたり...たまに友達やメンバーのらくがきをみてやる気を出してます...w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト前は深夜３時過ぎまではしてたかなぁ...テスト前はねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DDだけだまたまあやのとこ遊びにいってもいい〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非待ってますっ\nいつでも遊びに来てねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーティーメンで姉妹に例えると？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番上の姉\n料理もなんでも出来る\n白石まいちゃん\n２番目\nしっかりものででも甘え上手な\n衛藤みさちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３番目\n天真爛漫なおてんば娘の\nせいらりん\n４番目\n自分の考えをしっかり持っててノリの良い\n生駒ちゃん\n五番目\n自由でマイペースなでもめんどうみのよい\n畠中せいらちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかよくわからんことになったけどこんなかんじ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！今日はここまで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやるねっ♪沢山の質問ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問の答えは松村のさゆりんでしたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家の愛犬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の温かくて、元気が出るコメント！凄くパワーもらってますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからまた勉強頑張りま~す"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験生の皆さん\n一緒に頑張りましょう―！＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"I love you (〃ω〃)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/10/5560581/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}